    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1018">

                <pb facs="1130" n="1034" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1034"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Woodford to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-19"><hi rendition="#italic">February 19,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 149.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Yesterday, the 18th instant, I had the
                    honor to telegraph the President as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">February 18, 1898.</hi></p>
                        <p rendition="#flush">President <hi rendition="#small-caps">McKinley</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                        <p>Her Majesty the Queen has just sent one of the gentlemen of the royal
                            household to express, through me to Your Excellency, her profound sorrow
                            and sympathy in the sad accident which has befallen the U. S. S. <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Maine</hi> at Habana.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodford.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I have, etc.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stewart L. Woodford.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
